{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MjAwMA==","is_bot":false,"login":"magnus919","name":"Magnus Hedemark"},"body":"## Summary\n\nReject an already-expired HTTP operation using its owner clock before request accounting, transport dispatch, or client checkout. Stop/cancellation precedence and the existing in-flight deadline path remain intact; the portal response and error contract do not change.\n\nPublished revision: `3f1b9ccadb2a1f5ec072c64a2cd1dcd53d3b8dc8` (DCO signed).\n\n## Current local qualification\n\nThe qualified candidate is the working-tree source based at commit `6aa01ed3ee268224ab159311581df3f5173e502a`, against `origin/main` `4b7156d3915fce29f84d39b077101f9d233fc248`; the four dirty source/amendment paths are not contained in that base commit. The sealed source packet is `pr1034-marker-namespace-qualification-v1/FINAL-MANIFEST.json` (SHA-256 `31c5dbd081f6a62ead5fddf04bb73e4fc5b374d62bbb354cd7e8e03deb331610`). It pins HTTP source `c5116d9a0081a0497a12643440053f001b6d68b48e9b4bf8c5feabf81eed5d10` and helper `edb8ac754f54c78da747296bf0a115ef4d04d289e9ba10b8f76a32168c092c2a`. The helper delta from the predecessor is two diagnostic-label renames that remove the `A13_` prefix rejected by strict namespace validation; the parser itself is unchanged.\n\nOn this source, Rustfmt, strict workspace/all-target Clippy, all 112 xtask tests, A13 (75 selectors; 82 typed commands, zero nonzero), and W06 (73 commands, zero nonzero; 303 completions) passed. Prior 291 infrastructure tests and other common-runtime checks are predecessor evidence and were not rerun for the two-label delta.\n\n## Remaining gates\n\nExact-new-head Linux AMD64 and ARM64 source inventories and the portal inventory/impact gate remain required before merge. Published checks for old head `191537e2003c51064a1e17739f3300b1e5ac4a8c` are historical and do not satisfy them. Local macOS evidence alone does not close #1032. No performance or full milestone-closure claim is made.\n\nRelated to #1032\n\nAI-assisted contribution reviewed and owned by the contributor.\n\nRepository checks: the AST-only graph update passed. The all-files pre-commit run found the existing Ruff formatting difference in `tests/test_coverage_saved_method_materials.py`; the unrelated file was preserved rather than included in this PR. All other hooks passed after reusing the existing local linter environment.\n\nScoped pre-commit over all 25 PR paths passed. The published commit contains the same 21 qualified source pins; the accompanying document records the working-tree qualification provenance.\n","headRefOid":"3f1b9ccadb2a1f5ec072c64a2cd1dcd53d3b8dc8","mergeStateStatus":"UNSTABLE","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-19T21:18:36Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/magnus919/SlopSearX/actions/runs/39326453447/job/118313528417","name":"droid","startedAt":"2026-10-19T21:18:46Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Droid Tag"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-19T21:18:59Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/magnus919/SlopSearX/actions/runs/39326503166/job/118313628668","name":"droid","startedAt":"2026-10-19T21:18:59Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Droid Tag"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-19T21:18:25Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/magnus919/SlopSearX/actions/runs/39326428486/job/118313421627","name":"observe","startedAt":"2026-10-19T21:18:31Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"SlopSearX protected source context probe (disabled)"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-19T21:18:42Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/magnus919/SlopSearX/actions/runs/39326432234/job/118313386413","name":"duplicate-detection","startedAt":"2026-10-19T21:18:29Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-19T21:19:41Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/magnus919/SlopSearX/actions/ru